{"4309130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEFENSORES DEL BARRIO", "steam_appid": 4309130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/e08eb3743782317cc2a23101d27f63c1.poster.avif?t=1772220812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/e08eb3743782317cc2a23101d27f63c1.webm?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/e08eb3743782317cc2a23101d27f63c1.mp4?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Defenders of the Neighborhood is here — a game packed with action, justice, and a whole lot of heart!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive in and step into the shoes of three unique heroes who never back down when it comes to defending what they love most: their people, their neighborhood, their land. <i>Defenders of the Neighborhood</i> is an arcade game with three minigames that will make you feel the adrenaline of fighting for what’s right — and it’s not to be missed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRUZ NEGRA — Defender of childhood and justice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this hard-hitting beat ’em up, Cruz Negra is a fearless boxer who must protect a children’s soup kitchen from attacks by drug traffickers and corrupt police officers. Throw punches to protect the kids of the neighborhood! This is pure hand-to-hand combat, all set in a single scenario where you’ll have to withstand wave after wave of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/b4bbb5e62e3f1695c9832eab56481c76.poster.avif?t=1772220812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/b4bbb5e62e3f1695c9832eab56481c76.webm?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/b4bbb5e62e3f1695c9832eab56481c76.mp4?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EL INFERNAL — Defender of the environment and national sovereignty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This industrial engineer suffered an accident and, instead of giving up, turned his body into a war machine. With El Infernal, you’ll take to the skies in a powerful vertical shmup. Shoot down foreign military forces trying to steal an Argentine ecological reserve and destroy the environment, while fiercely defending your country’s soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/8ddaf997084912de04ab29de1515c2ad.poster.avif?t=1772220812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/8ddaf997084912de04ab29de1515c2ad.webm?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/8ddaf997084912de04ab29de1515c2ad.mp4?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROLLER QUEEN — Defender of culture and public space</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your skates and get ready to go full speed in this infinite runner. Roller Queen is a circus performer who will do everything she can to stop vile businessmen from destroying a public square to build high-rises. With her torch, she’ll set fire to anyone in her way while dodging all kinds of obstacles and fighting for the neighborhood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/15afef40436904a1aef48461ba2283d3.poster.avif?t=1772220812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/15afef40436904a1aef48461ba2283d3.webm?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/15afef40436904a1aef48461ba2283d3.mp4?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What you’ll find:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three heroes, three stories, three play styles:</strong> From bare-knuckle brawling to the most frantic infinite-runner action, each hero has their own world to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-stop action:</strong> Fights, gunfire, and speed. You won’t stop for a second!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just causes:</strong> Fight corruption, environmental destruction, and corporate greed. A game with a message, where defending what’s yours matters more than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro arcade style:</strong> Feel the ’80s vibe, with modern visuals that will pull you in!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/1dbb1f8c885678e8ae1b476c2d4a2a34.poster.avif?t=1772220812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/1dbb1f8c885678e8ae1b476c2d4a2a34.webm?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/1dbb1f8c885678e8ae1b476c2d4a2a34.mp4?t=1772220812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Join the resistance and become a Defender of the Neighborhood!</strong><br>Because the true hero isn’t the one who wears a cape, but the one who defends what they love. Do you have what it takes to stop those who want to destroy your neighborhood? The fight starts now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​Diseñador, programador, animador, e ilustraciones: Tomás Pernich</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonido: Gino Gelsi, Tomás Pernich</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Música: Sr Pernich </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ilustración de poster: Hor Lang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agradecimientos: Gonzalo Vinent, Lucas Anfolisi, Flavio Pérez, Gabriel Cominotti, Emily And, Silvina Pulti, Natalia Castillo, Hernán Sáez, Fungal, comunidad Game Maker Argentina. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Todos los derechos reservados para Pernich Media. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras/83fd828f23fd9faa12e46424a1fb914a.avif?t=1772220812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4309130/extras_big/83fd828f23fd9faa12e46424a1fb914a.avif?t=1772220812 width=1560 height=2310 /><